{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "愛知県出身 22歳の岡本姫奈です！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "AnimeJapan 2026に行ってきました〜！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "入場したら 夢のような世界が広がってて\n本当に楽しかった！！！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "アニメの無い生活が考えられないくらい\n私にとってなくてはならないものです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とにかく幸せだったな〜〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "神フォトスポットがあったので"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "てれさと りりあちゃんと\n長蛇の列を並んで撮りました☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mobJNWq5U.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お父さんと一緒に 夜中まで起きてリアタイしてた時期が懐かしいです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "心臓を捧げよ！！！！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "舞台 「鬼太郎誕生 ゲゲゲの謎」の出店ブースにもお邪魔してきました👀"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mobMC7FWN.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "懐かしい小道具〜😭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "沢山の方が写真を撮って下さっていて嬉しかったです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またあの世界に戻れる日が来ますように🎀"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "長蛇の列が出来ていたので\nなんのアニメだろう？と覗き込んだら"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ドラゴンボールでした😭嬉しい‼️😭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mobGN3oSv.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mobW9BbrA.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大興奮でした！！！\nありがとうございます！！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みて笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mobUanCCS.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "高度育成高等学校 絶対に入れなさそう。\n浮きすぎている。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "や〜 全部楽しかった\n1日じゃ全然足りなかった！！😭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "写真がまだまだ 沢山あるのでインスタグラムの方で載せますね！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🔗https://www.instagram.com/okamotohina_official"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "見てくださったらうれしいです☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでいただきありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また書きます☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日の1曲 心臓を捧げよ！/\nLinked Horizonさん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "来年は大阪で開催されるみたい。\n行きたいなあ〜！"}], "source": "official"}